This directory is the default location for static OpenIFS data files.

The data files can be downloaded from:
https://openifs.ecmwf.int/data/ifsdata/

Note: Depending on the number of selected model grid resolutions in the
climate-version files, the downloaded data volume can be substantial.
By default, all data packages are extracted to the $OIFS_HOME/openifs-data/
directory. Please ensure that sufficient disk space is available.

Alternatively, you can replace this directory with a symbolic link to
another location on your file system.

